{"id":"432c4bc700976332","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular.md","title":"一个标签也足以产生非正则嵌套","display":"ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular — 一个标签也足以产生非正则嵌套","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular","aliases":["73-ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular"],"display":"ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular — 一个标签也足以产生非正则嵌套","depends_on":["[[73-df-tagged-tree-serialization]]","[[73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence]]","[[73-thm-regular-language-operations]]","[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.3.3–5.3.4, print pp. 198–206; PDF pp. 220–228; local nesting witness","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular — 一个标签也足以产生非正则嵌套"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d6a515cab34a133\" href=\"?note=7d6a515cab34a133\" title=\"73-df-tagged-tree-serialization\">73-df-tagged-tree-serialization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c730666c3868e4e7\" href=\"?note=c730666c3868e4e7\" title=\"73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence\">73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8\" href=\"?note=aa8bbf232c5a7ab8\" title=\"73-thm-regular-language-operations\">73-thm-regular-language-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" href=\"?note=e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" title=\"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping\">73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.3.3–5.3.4, print pp. 198–206; PDF pp. 220–228; local nesting witness"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\{a\\}\">\\(T=\\{a\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=a\">\\(s=a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T\">\\(C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(a)=(\\mathbf a)^\\star\">\\(C(a)=(\\mathbf a)^\\star\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{o,c\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{o,c\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\ne c\">\\(o\\ne c\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{op}(a)=o\">\\(\\mathrm{op}(a)=o\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cl}(a)=c\">\\(\\mathrm{cl}(a)=c\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,a,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\">\\(L=\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,a,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\{o,c\\}}\\land L\\notin\\mathsf{REG}_{\\{o,c\\}},\\qquad\nL\\cap\\{o\\}^*\\{c\\}^*=\\{o^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\{o,c\\}}\\land L\\notin\\mathsf{REG}_{\\{o,c\\}},\\qquad\nL\\cap\\{o\\}^*\\{c\\}^*=\\{o^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交中的词只能对应一条单孩子链；否则某个子树闭合后还会出现新的开标签，不属于 o<em>c</em>。右侧配对计数语言非正则，所以由正则交封闭推出 L 非正则。该语言只含一棵根树的序列化，不包括空文档或多棵根树的任意串接。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-tagged-tree-serialization","status":"resolved","id":"7d6a515cab34a133","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-tagged-tree-serialization]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"c730666c3868e4e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-regular-language-operations","status":"resolved","id":"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-language-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","status":"resolved","id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\{a\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"s=a","display":false},{"tex":"C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T","display":false},{"tex":"C(a)=(\\mathbf a)^\\star","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{o,c\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"o\\ne c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{op}(a)=o","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cl}(a)=c","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,a,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\{o,c\\}}\\land L\\notin\\mathsf{REG}_{\\{o,c\\}},\\qquad\nL\\cap\\{o\\}^*\\{c\\}^*=\\{o^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1716,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-single-tag-nesting-nonregular|一个标签也足以产生非正则嵌套]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["7d6a515cab34a133","c730666c3868e4e7","aa8bbf232c5a7ab8","e48ecbf40a3c92b6"]}